etric-codes-cs-D2IV-Antihypertensive\">D2IV-Antihypertensive</a></td><td>Door to IV Antihypertensive</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-D2SysBP.60140\">D2SysBP&lt;140</a></td><td>Door to Systolic Blood Pressure &lt; 140 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-D2R\">D2R</a></td><td>Door to Reperfusion</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-O2D\">O2D</a></td><td>Onset to Door</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-highest-sys-bp-after-24-hours\">highest-sys-bp-after-24-hours</a></td><td>Highest Systolic Blood Pressure After 24 Hours</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-G2R\">G2R</a></td><td>Groin to Reperfusion</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-temperature-checks-day-1\">temperature-checks-day-1</a></td><td>Temperature Checks Day 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-temperature-checks-day-2\">temperature-checks-day-2</a></td><td>Temperature Checks Day 2</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-temperature-checks-day-3\">temperature-checks-day-3</a></td><td>Temperature Checks Day 3</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-hyperglycemia-day-1\">hyperglycemia-day-1</a></td><td>Hyperglycemia Checks Day 1</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-hyperglycemia-day-2\">hyperglycemia-day-2</a></td><td>Hyperglycemia Checks Day 2</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric-codes-cs-hyperglycemia-day-3\">hyperglycemia-day-3</a></td><td>Hyperglycemia Checks Day 3</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-timing-metric-codes-cs.html#timing-metric